WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Do you need information
about how to go to court

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.000
or how to find a lawyer
in one of the 27 Member States of the EU?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Or are you a lawyer, a notary or a judge
and need to get in contact with colleagues around Europe?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.500
The e-Justice Portal is the answer for your need.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.500
Go to e-justice.europa.eu
and choose the portal in your own language.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.000
In the menu on the left side of the portal
you have the entrance to an unlimited amount of information.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.000
For legal practitioners the portal
has information on case law.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.000
It tells you how to serve judicial documents
and helps you with tools

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.500
for dealing with cross border cases. 
such as videoconferencing.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.500
Find out how the judicial system works in Estonia
or how to bring a case to court in Austria.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
If you need to get a divorce
or have questions regarding custody,

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.000
consult the family matters section. 

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.000
Have you been a victim of a crime?
The e-Justice Portal offers you information about

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.500
how to apply for a compensation.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.500
The e-Justice Portal also has
information about what to do

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.500
if you have received an inheritance
from another member state,
0:01:02.500,0:00:07.000
or if you want to resolve a dispute
by mediation instead of going to court.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.500
The e-Justice Portal is the easiest way
to find information

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:15.500
about both the different national legal systems
and also about cross border justice.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.500
We are constantly improving our site so you can
access the information you want as easily as possible.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.500
Go to our website and try us out.

